  "instructions": [
    "Combine beets, carrots, and onions in a large clay pot or Dutch oven.",
    "Peel the beets and slice them into large wedges.",
    "Add garlic to the pot and cook until fragrant.",
    "Add fish fillets to the pot and cook until they are opaque and flake easily with a fork.",
    "Add vegetable broth to the pot and bring to a boil.",
    "Reduce heat to low and simmer for 10 minutes.",
    "Stir in crème fraîche and sour cream (if using).",
    "Season with black pepper to taste.",
    "Garnish with chopped fresh dill (if using).",
    "Serve hot, ladled into bowls and topped with additional crème fraîche and dill (if desired)."
